*.avif binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.gif binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.ods binary
*.xlsx binary
